  "primaryText": "Phanteks 追風者\n關於我們\n獲獎紀錄\nToggle navigation\n首頁\n產品\nEnthoo 系列機箱\nElite  | Elite Server\nPrimo\nPrimo SE\nEnthoo 719\nLuxe  |  Tempered\nPro 2 Tempered |  Closed  |  Server |  Server V2\nPro |  Tempered\nPro SE\nPro M  |  Acrylic  |  Tempered\nPro M SE\nMini XL DS\nMini XL\nEvolv 系列機箱\nEvolv S2\nEvolv X2 Matrix\nEvolv X2\nEvolv X\nEvolv ATX  |  Tempered\nEvolv mATX Tempered Glass\nEvolv ITX |  Tempered\nEvolv Shift X\nEvolv Shift 2 |  Air\nEvolv Shift\nEvolv Shift Air |  Mesh Panel\nEvolv Shift XT  |  LCD Display\nXT 系列機箱\nXT View Matrix\nXT View |  Matrix-600 Kit\nXT V5 |  LCD\nXT V3\nXT M5\nXT M3\nXT Pro |  XT Pro Ultra\nXT Pro Silent\nNV 系列機箱\nNV9  |  LED KIT\nNV7  |  LED KIT\nNV5  |  LED KIT\nNV9 MKII  |  LED KIT\nNV5 MKII  |  LED KIT\nNV5S\nNV5X\nEclipse 系列機箱\nG500A  |  DRGB\nG400A |  Matrix-600 Kit\nG370A\nG360A\nG300A\nP600S\nP500A  |  DRGB\nP400  |  Tempered\nP400A  |  Mesh Front Panel\nP400S  |  Tempered\nP360A\nP360X\nP350X\nP300A\nP300 Tempered\nP200A DRGB  |  Performance\n電源供應器\nRevolt  |  Cable Kit\nRevolt X\nRevolt Pro\nRevolt SFX  |  PCIe 5.0\nAMP Series\nAMP GH Series\n喇叭\nEvolv Sound Mini\n一體式水冷散熱器\nGlacier One D30 X2\nGlacier One M25 LCD\nGlacier One M25 GEN2\nGlacier One T30  |  v2\nGlacier One D30\nGlacier One MP\nGlacier One MPH\n水冷散熱產品\nGlacier Ez-Fit\nCPU Blocks\nGPU Blocks\nFittings\nReservoirs\nDistribution Plate\nCPU風冷散熱器\nPH-TC14PE\nPH-TC14S\nPH-TC12DX\nPH-TC12LS  |  RGB\nPolar ST4\nPolar ST5\n風扇\nM25-120 GEN2  |  DRGB\nM25-140 GEN2  |  DRGB\nT30 120\nT30 140\nD30 120\nD30 140\nM25 120  |  DRGB\nM25 140  |  DRGB\nMP 120  |  V2\nMP 140  |  V2\nSK 120  |  D-RGB\nSK 140  |  D-RGB\nSP 120  |  SP 120 LED\nSP 140  |  SP 140 LED\nSP 200\nXP 120\nXP 140\nHP 140  |  HP 140 II\n配件\nMatrix-600 Kit\nUniversal LCD Display\nRevolt Cable Kit\n12VHPWR PCI-E 5.0 Power Cable\nDigital RGB LED Products\nRGB LED Products\nNV5 PREMIUM LED KIT\nNEXLINQ HUB\nUniversal Fan Controller\nPower Combo\nPower Splitter\nPWM Fan Hub\nPump Bracket\nSSD Bracket\nY-Splitters\nExtension Combo\nExtension Cables\nITX Upgrade Kits\n3.5\" HDD Bracket  |  Modular  |  Stackable\nDual 5.25\" ODD Bracket for Enthoo 719\nThermal Compound\nTool Kit\nRiser Cables  |  PCI-E 4.0\nVertical GPU Kit  |  PCI-E 4.0  |  Premium  |  Premium Gen5\n評測\n關於我們\n購買\n×\n首頁\nPSU\nAMP Series\nAMP系列全模組化電源供應器\n產品型號 : PH-P1000G/PH-P1000G_02/PH-P1000G_WT01/PH-P1000G_WT02/PH-P850G/PH-P750G/PH-P650G/PH-P550G\nPhanteks AMP系列電源供應器\nWattage\n1000 Watt\n1000 Watt White\n850 Watt\n750 Watt\n650 Watt\n550 Watt\n簡介\n規格\n使用手冊\n特點:\nPhanteks AMP系列是與Seasonic共同合作開發之產品，高品質80PLUS金牌認證電源。全模組化導線可以大幅度減少連接電線雜亂的現象，使用套管和扁平帶狀電纜，使系統安裝後更為簡潔美觀。120mm流體動力軸承風扇可在混合風扇模式下進行溫度控制，實現極致的靜音性能。 Phanteks AMP電源經過認證，可確保與Revolt Pro電源供應器100％兼容。\nInstallation\nPH-P1000G\nPH-P1000G_02\nPH-P1000G_WT01\nPH-P1000G_WT02\nPH-P850G\nPH-P750G\nPH-P650G\nPH-P550G\n886523500971\n886523510123\n886523500988\n886523510130\n886523500933\n886523500834\n886523500841\n886523500858\nEnglish\n支援\n台灣地區\n+886-2-82263328\nsupport.tw@phanteks.com\n快速連結\n機箱\n電源供應器\n水冷散熱產品\n風冷CPU散熱器\n風扇\n裝機配件\n幫助\n客戶服務\n產品保固\n常見問題\n使用手冊\nPHANTEKS 社群\n© Phanteks 2024. All right reserved.",
